# Page- and Screen-Wise Performance Optimization Plan

## Next.js / React Website --- Safe Optimization Without UI or Functionality Regression

## 1. Objective

Improve Lighthouse performance across desktop and mobile, with
particular focus on mobile devices and throttled networks, **without
changing existing UI layouts, visual design, business logic, content
behavior, routes, or integrations**.

### Baseline from the performance report

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Metric                                Desktop        Mobile / Throttled
